{"id":"luna","lemma":"luna","pos":"noun","rank":714,"glosses":["moon","windshield","shirt"],"ipa":"/ˈluna/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lunas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-luna.wav","examples":[{"text":"Se ve la luna.","en":"The moon is out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442197"},{"text":"Marte tiene dos lunas.","en":"Mars has two moons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104066"},{"text":"Nadie posee la luna.","en":"Nobody owns the moon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453279"},{"text":"Alrededor de Saturno orbitan muchas lunas.","en":"Many moons orbit around Saturn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733536"},{"text":"Ha salido la luna.","en":"The moon has come out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460968"}]}